    ($SATQ$40c3589d$SATQ$, $SATQ$be33fee3-fb20-4b3e-9938-f3ad06edd6a6$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$7923ca8e-3bb1-4daa-83e6-7f208ae2b208$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$Reading and Writing$SATQ$, $SATQ$Standard English Conventions$SATQ$, $SATQ$SEC$SATQ$, $SATQ$BOU$SATQ$, $SATQ$Boundaries$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>Luci Tapahonso is the inaugural poet laureate of the Navajo Nation. Her book <em>S&aacute;anii Dahataal/The Women Are Singing</em>&mdash;a combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and <span aria-hidden="true">______</span><span class="sr-only">blank</span> serves as a testament to her versatility as a writer.</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"90326e2d-74e6-4572-b354-3d8a7c509189","content":"<p>prose;</p>"},{"id":"4b0f3ca7-617a-4c43-a2b7-4d529b3678e4","content":"<p>prose</p>"},{"id":"bc156bd8-9435-4e7c-8982-6ed449dede04","content":"<p>prose,</p>"},{"id":"ce055a8c-9f7c-42c8-a979-9c4a391f7b4c","content":"<p>prose&mdash;</p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["ce055a8c-9f7c-42c8-a979-9c4a391f7b4c"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice D is the best answer. &ldquo;A combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and prose&rdquo; is a nonessential supplement, so it needs to be set off from the rest of the sentence with a pair of matching punctuation marks. We already have a dash at the beginning of the supplement, so we need to add a dash at the end of the supplement to match.&nbsp;</p><p>Choice A is incorrect. This doesn&rsquo;t complete the text in a way that conforms to the conventions of Standard English. &ldquo;A combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and prose&rdquo; is a nonessential supplement, so it needs to be set off from the rest of the sentence with a pair of matching punctuation marks. We already have a dash at the beginning of the supplement, so we need to add a dash at the end of the supplement to match.&nbsp;Choice B is incorrect. This doesn&rsquo;t complete the text in a way that conforms to the conventions of Standard English. &ldquo;A combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and prose&rdquo; is a nonessential supplement, so it needs to be set off from the rest of the sentence with a pair of matching punctuation marks. We already have a dash at the beginning of the supplement, so we need to add a dash at the end of the supplement to match.&nbsp;Choice C is incorrect. This doesn&rsquo;t complete the text in a way that conforms to the conventions of Standard English. &ldquo;A combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and prose&rdquo; is a nonessential supplement, so it needs to be set off from the rest of the sentence with a pair of matching punctuation marks. We already have a dash at the beginning of the supplement, so we need to add a dash at the end of the supplement to match.&nbsp;</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, $SATQ$OSP-614-SEC$SATQ$, $SATQ$$SATQ$, $SATQ$7d6c600b-1a46-43c0-b390-c3dc1d13275a$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$$SATQ$, $SATQ$proteus$SATQ$, $SATQ$0$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"40c3589d","external_id":"be33fee3-fb20-4b3e-9938-f3ad06edd6a6","vaultid":"7923ca8e-3bb1-4daa-83e6-7f208ae2b208","uId":"a278e54d-1598-46f9-9770-7e107dee4816","program":"SAT","test_type":1,"test_type_desc":"Reading and Writing","primary_class_cd":"SEC","domain":"Standard English Conventions","skill_cd":"BOU","skill_desc":"Boundaries","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":5,"type":"mcq","stimulus":"<p>Luci Tapahonso is the inaugural poet laureate of the Navajo Nation. Her book <em>S&aacute;anii Dahataal/The Women Are Singing</em>&mdash;a combination of fiction and memoir, poetry and <span aria-hidden=\"true\">______</span><span class=\"sr-only\">blank</span> serves as a testament to her versatility as a writer.</p>","stem":"<p>Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"90326e2d-74e6-4572-b354-3d8a7c50